silm:instances_papers_04_forge_sections_08_kg_cross_reference_concrete_anchor_2 silm:hasExample "In 'ConcreteAnchor — 08_kg_cross_reference #2', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, In section 'Knowledge-Graph Cross-Reference --- The Forge as Knowledge Map' the bare symbol |[classnode]| DomesticCat anchors to MittensVetRecordBackendTarget: The backend write target: the storage row where the typed measurement claim lands after routing — the row carries source key, value, date, observer, gate status.." .
